  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Skattef&#xF6;rvaltning studie</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tax Administration study</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">I juni &#xE5;r 2002 fick Sida en formell f&#xF6;rfr&#xE5;gan om st&#xF6;d till den Serbiska skattemyndigheten (PRA). F&#xF6;rfr&#xE5;gan diskuterades b&#xE5;de p&#xE5; den svenska ambassaden i Belgrad och p&#xE5; Sida i Stockholm. Resultatet blev att Sida har &#xF6;vers&#xE4;nt PRAs f&#xF6;rfr&#xE5;gan till Riksskatteverket vilka har uttalat intresse att g&#xF6;ra en kvalitativ utredning av fr&#xE5;gan.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In June 2002 Sida received a formal request from the Serbian Public Revenue Agency (PRA) regaring institutional support from Sweden to PRA. The request have been discussed at the Swedish Embassy in Belgrade and in meetings between Sida and PRA. Sida have approached the Swedish Tax Authority (RSV) who have confirmed an interest to to visit PRA and analyse relevance and needs for Swedish support.</narrative>
  </description>
